    "description": "Proposed Counterterrorism Law risks more abuses: Human Rights Watch",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Proposed-Counterterrorism-Law-risks-more-abuses-Human-Rights-Watch/14-787244",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
